# {{ project_name }}

Install uv, Node 24, pnpm and Go Task. Doctor uses an available Python interpreter (Python 3.10+).

```sh
task doctor
task setup
{% if enable_jobs %}
task jobs:redis
# Separate terminal: task jobs:worker
{% endif %}
